      "kind": "talk",
      "html": "<h2 class='lt'>Counting</h2><p class='lnote'>3 shirts, 2 pants. How many outfits?</p><div class='fig'><svg viewBox='0 15 310 210' style='max-width:330px' role='img'><circle cx='20' cy='120' r='7' class='fa'/><line x1='20' y1='120' x2='120' y2='40' class='ln'/><rect x='108' y='26' width='70' height='28' rx='8' class='fc'/><text x='143' y='46' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>red</text><g data-seg='2'><line x1='178' y1='40' x2='240' y2='22' class='ln'/><text x='246' y='27' style='font-size:15px'>jeans</text></g><g data-seg='2'><line x1='178' y1='40' x2='240' y2='58' class='ln'/><text x='246' y='63' style='font-size:15px'>shorts</text></g><line x1='20' y1='120' x2='120' y2='120' class='ln'/><rect x='108' y='106' width='70' height='28' rx='8' class='fc'/><text x='143' y='126' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>blue</text><g data-seg='2'><line x1='178' y1='120' x2='240' y2='102' class='ln'/><text x='246' y='107' style='font-size:15px'>jeans</text></g><g data-seg='2'><line x1='178' y1='120' x2='240' y2='138' class='ln'/><text x='246' y='143' style='font-size:15px'>shorts</text></g><line x1='20' y1='120' x2='120' y2='200' class='ln'/><rect x='108' y='186' width='70' height='28' rx='8' class='fc'/><text x='143' y='206' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>green</text><g data-seg='2'><line x1='178' y1='200' x2='240' y2='182' class='ln'/><text x='246' y='187' style='font-size:15px'>jeans</text></g><g data-seg='2'><line x1='178' y1='200' x2='240' y2='218' class='ln'/><text x='246' y='223' style='font-size:15px'>shorts</text></g></svg></div><div class='eq' data-seg='3'>3 × 2 = 6 outfits</div>",
      "say": [
