='middle' style='font-size:15px'>5</text><rect x='128' y='108' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='149' y='130' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>6</text><rect x='172' y='108' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fh'/><text x='193' y='130' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>7</text><rect x='216' y='108' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='237' y='130' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>8</text><rect x='260' y='108' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='281' y='130' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>9</text><rect x='40' y='142' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='61' y='164' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>5</text><rect x='84' y='142' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='105' y='164' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>6</text><rect x='128' y='142' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fh'/><text x='149' y='164' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>7</text><rect x='172' y='142' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='193' y='164' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>8</text><rect x='216' y='142' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='237' y='164' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>9</text><rect x='260' y='142' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='281' y='164' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>10</text><rect x='40' y='176' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='61' y='198' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>6</text><rect x='84' y='176' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fh'/><text x='105' y='198' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>7</text><rect x='128' y='176' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='149' y='198' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>8</text><rect x='172' y='176' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='193' y='198' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>9</text><rect x='216' y='176' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='237' y='198' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>10</text><rect x='260' y='176' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='281' y='198' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>11</text><rect x='40' y='210' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fh'/><text x='61' y='232' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>7</text><rect x='84' y='210' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='105' y='232' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>8</text><rect x='128' y='210' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='149' y='232' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>9</text><rect x='172' y='210' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='193' y='232' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>10</text><rect x='216' y='210' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='237' y='232' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>11</text><rect x='260' y='210' width='42' height='32' rx='4' class='fc'/><text x='281' y='232' text-anchor='middle' style='font-size:15px'>12</text><text x='62' y='30' text-anchor='middle' class='ta'>1</text><text x='26' y='62' text-anchor='middle' class='ta'>1</text><text x='106' y='30' text-anchor='middle' class='ta'>2</text><text x='26' y='96' text-anchor='middle' class='ta'>2</text><text x='150' y='30' text-anchor='middle' class='ta'>3</text><text x='26' y='130' text-anchor='middle' class='ta'>3</text><text x='194' y='30' text-anchor='middle' class='ta'>4</text><text x='26' y='164' text-anchor='middle' class='ta'>4</text><text x='238' y='30' text-anchor='middle' class='ta'>5</text><text x='26' y='198' text-anchor='middle' class='ta'>5</text><text x='282' y='30' text-anchor='middle' class='ta'>6</text><text x='26' y='232' text-anchor='middle' class='ta'>6</text></svg></div><p class='tip' data-seg='1'>Sums are <b>not</b> equally likely! A sum of 2 happens 1 way. A sum of 7 happens <b>6</b> ways.</p>",
      "say": [
        "Now two dice. Each die has six outcomes, so together there are six times six, thirty-six outcomes. This grid shows every sum.",
        "Look carefully: the sums are not equally likely. A sum of two only happens one way, a one and a one. But a sum of seven happens six different ways. See the yellow diagonal."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "choose",
      "html": "<p class='lq'>Two fair dice are rolled. What is the probability the sum is 7?</p>",
      "say": [
        "Two fair dice are rolled. What's the probability the sum is seven?"
      ],
      "choices": [
        "<span class='frac'><span>1</span><span>11</span></span>",
        "<span class='frac'><span>1</span><span>12</span></span>",
        "<span class='frac'><span>1</span><span>6</span></span>",
        "<span class='frac'><span>7</span><span>36</span></span>"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "ok": "Yes! 6 ways out of 36: <span class='frac'><span>6</span><span>36</span></span> = <span class='frac'><span>1</span><span>6</span></span>.",
      "okSay": "Yes! Six ways out of thirty-six, which is one sixth.",
      "no": "Count the grid: 7 happens 6 ways out of 36 → <span class='frac'><span>6</span><span>36</span></span> = <b><span class='frac'><span>1</span><span>6</span></span></b>. There are 11 possible sums, but they aren't equally likely, so it's not <span class='frac'><span>1</span><span>11</span></span>.",
      "noSay": "Not quite. A sum of seven happens six ways, out of thirty-six. That's one sixth. There are eleven possible sums, but they aren't equally likely, so it's not one eleventh."
    },
    {
      "kind": "talk",
      "html": "<p class='lq'>“And” → multiply</p><div class='eqs'><div data-seg='1'>P(coin = heads) = <span class='frac'><span>1</span><span>2</span></span></div><div data-seg='1'>P(die = 6) = <span class='frac'><span>1</span><span>6</span></span></div><div data-seg='2' class='hot'>P(heads <b>and</b> 6) = <span class='frac'><span>1</span><span>2</span></span> × <span class='frac'><span>1</span><span>6</span></span> = <span class='frac'><span>1</span><span>12</span></span></div></div><div class='mnem' data-seg='3'><b>AND</b> → multiply. Two things both happening is <b>less</b> likely, so the answer gets smaller.</div>",
      "say": [
