      "kind": "talk",
      "html": "<h2 class='lt'>Remember</h2><div class='rule'><p><b>1.</b> Counting: <b>multiply</b> the choices. 3 shirts × 2 pants = 6.</p><p data-seg='1'><b>2.</b> Ordering: 3 × 2 × 1. One fewer choice each spot.</p><p data-seg='2'><b>3.</b> Two dice: 36 outcomes. Sum of 7 is the most likely (6 ways).</p><p data-seg='3'><b>4.</b> AND → multiply. Not putting it back? The second fraction changes.</p></div>",
